### `333 service install`: whether the program a service would run is still there tomorrow.

service-exe-asking = 正在詢問系統這個程式在哪裡

service-exe-fleeting = 這個程式從 { $exe } 執行，那是{ $why }。指向它的服務會在它消失
    的那天停止。把它複製到 { $home }，從那裡執行 `service install`。

service-exe-emptied = 系統會清空的目錄
service-exe-build-directory = 構建目錄，下次構建會替換它
